  "overview": "When the owner of a home study academy for wayward girls is faced with looming debt, he has no choice but to enlist the help of John Mahler, a lone educator with a heart of gold. Principal Kevin Stevenson and Dr. Bill Race are confronted by Mr. Frank who wants his money. Unable to pay, Stevenson makes the call to Mahler. What follows is a story of hope, help, and inspiration as Mahler helps all of the students and (against all odds) will try to clear them for release, which will help Stevenson be able to take care of his debt. Starring Johnny Mask, Bryan Brewer, Chris Spinelli, Sofia Studenikina, Sofia Papuashvili, Jamie Grefe, and Hazel Gonzalez, BAD GIRLS GO HOME is a vertical feature film unlike anything you've ever seen before. Filled with drama, heartfelt emotion, human conflict, and heartwarming inspiration, BAD GIRLS GO HOME will inspire you to do better and to be better.",
